SUMMARY:Kentuckiana Fly Fishing Show 2027
DESCRIPTION:Kentuckiana Fly Fishing Show 2027 Hosted by Derby City Fly Fishers \nThe Kentuckiana Fly Show is focused on fly fishing and everything required to pursue the sport for beginners through accomplished anglers. \n\nOver 40 vendors and exhibitors from surrounding states to make purchases or just ask questions.\nCasting demonstrations and seminars on fly fishing will be presented throughout the day.\nFly tiers demonstrating the art and craft of fly tying.\n“Kids Corner” where children of all ages are welcome to tie a fly that they can take with them. All tools and materials will be furnished free of charge.\nRepresentatives from the Kentucky and Indiana Departments of Fish and Wildlife will be available to answer any questions concerning state fishing regulations and opportunities.\nCasting instruction throughout the day for anyone interested in learning to cast a fly rod.
URL:https://www.hoosierflyfishers.com/event/kentuckiana-fly-fishing-show-2027/
LOCATION:Paroquet Springs Conference Center\, 395 Paroquet Springs Drive\, Shepherdsville\, KY\, 40165
CATEGORIES:Fly Fishing Events
END:VEVENT
