SUMMARY:The Heartland Fly Fishing Festival 2027
DESCRIPTION:Heartland Fly Fishing Festival Boone County 4-H Fairgrounds Lebanon\, IN Witham Pavilion\n\nConveniently located just 15 minute north of Indianapolis off I-65 \nAmple parking and it’s free. \nHours: 9:00 am- 5:00 pm \nAdmission: $15.00. Under 12 admitted free. \nMilitary and retired military\, no charge. \nHosted by Project Healing Waters Fly Fishing \nIndianapolis Program \nService animals only.
URL:https://www.hoosierflyfishers.com/event/the-heartland-fly-fishing-festival-2027/
LOCATION:Boone County 4H Fairgrounds\, Lebanon\, Indiana\, 46052
CATEGORIES:Fly Fishing Events
END:VEVENT
