SUMMARY:Indiana Fishing Expo
DESCRIPTION:Indiana Fishing Expo brought to you by Just Add Water Boats \nFeb 6th-7th 2027 \nHendricks County Fairgrounds Danville\, Indiana \nMostly conventional but some fly stuff too. Guides\, Moving Waters Outfitters\, and Sweet Creek Fly Guides. \n 
